## 1. Top Port-Worthy Patterns (ranked by value × portability)

| # | Pattern | Source | Portability | Effort | Value | Target |
|---|---------|--------|-------------|--------|-------|--------|
| 1 | `SmartRetrieval` pipeline (RRF + recency + MMR + session diversity) | `v3\@claude-flow\memory\src\smart-retrieval.ts` | **algorithm** | medium | **high** | `gemas_core/core/smart_retrieval.py` (pluggable `SearchFn` → rewrap `brain_recall`/`retrieval_search` from the MCP bridge) |
| 2 | `MemoryConsolidator` (sweep / dedup / compact) | `v3\@claude-flow\memory\src\consolidator.ts` | **algorithm** | medium | **high** | `gemas_core/core/memory_consolidator.py` (operates on `nexus_memory.db` from MCP) |
| 3 | `MemoryType` taxonomy + `AccessLevel` + `MemoryEntry` | `v3\@claude-flow\memory\src\types.ts` | **protocol-contract** | small | **high** | `gemas_core/core/memory_types.py` (dataclasses; align with `hierarchical_memory` tiers) |
| 4 | 19-event `HookEvent` enum + 5-level `HookPriority` | `v3\@claude-flow\hooks\src\types.ts` | **protocol-contract** | small | **high** | `gemas_core/core/hook_events.py` (Python `StrEnum` + `IntEnum`); back the existing `plan_mode` blocklist |
| 5 | Worker MCP allowlist + Zod-style input validation | `v3\@claude-flow\hooks\src\workers\mcp-tools.ts` | **algorithm** | small | medium | `gemas_core/core/mcp_input_validation.py` (Python `pydantic` model for `nexus-sovereign` tool args) |
| 6 | `Agent` aggregate root (DDD) with `AgentRole` + `AgentStatus` | `v3\@claude-flow\swarm\src\domain\entities\agent.ts` | **algorithm** | small | medium | `gemas_core/core/agent_model.py` (reusable for any new gemas in `gemas_client_overrides/`) |
| 7 | `Task` entity with dependency graph + `TaskPriority` | `v3\@claude-flow\swarm\src\domain\entities\task.ts` | **protocol-contract** | small | medium | `gemas_core/core/task_model.py` (lets `dispatch.py` grow DAG-style dispatch) |
| 8 | `TeammateBridge` mailbox/plan-approval handshake | `v3\plugins\teammate-plugin\src\teammate-bridge.ts` | **protocol-contract** | medium | medium | New MCP tools: `delegate_to_peer`, `approve_plan`, `sync_session` (additive, do not replace `send_message`/`read_messages`) |
| 9 | `SemanticRouter` (BMSSP topology optimization) | `v3\plugins\teammate-plugin\src\semantic-router.ts` | **algorithm** | medium | medium | `gemas_core/core/semantic_router.py` (wraps existing `classify_task` MCP tool) |
