| 11 | `safeNum` defensive coercion (regression #1686) | `v3\@claude-flow\cli\src\commands\hooks.ts` | **algorithm** | trivial | low | Tiny `gemas_core/core/safe_num.py` — drop-in JSON-parse hardening |
