## Appendix: Constraint Compliance Audit

- ✅ 5 dedicated workers (`ayuda`, `scholar`, `sage`, `biblioteca`, `prompter`) — **not** proposed for replacement
- ✅ `dispatch_gema` — only extended, never replaced
- ✅ `nexus-sovereign` MCP tools — all proposals are additive new tools, never replacements
- ✅ `message_board.db` — all proposals are additive new tables, never schema-breaking changes
- ✅ All proposed modules target `gemas_core/core/`, `gemas_core/teammate/`, or `gemas_client_overrides/` (valid extension points)
- ✅ All proposed gemas target `gemas_core/workers/` or `gemas_client_overrides/`
- ✅ Existing modules `hierarchical_memory`, `multi_signal_retrieval`, `self_learning_loop` are **integrated with**, not replaced by, the new ports

